  "description": "*“Please let this crush crash and burn!”*\n\nA romance story with a female lead who doesn’t want her unrequited love to come true?! Cho-Hui is on a mission to sabotage her own unrequited love. But when Shi-Ho discovers her secret, he blackmails her into making a deal with him. As if that weren't enough, I-Tae uncovers Shi-Ho's own unrequited love, turning everything into a tangled mess. Welcome to the story of a chaotic love triangle, where three people do everything they can to ruin each other's unrequited love!\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
